`verilator_config
// sys/hps_io.sv (the framework, byte-identical upstream) assigns its kbd/mouse port outputs
// procedurally while declaring them as nets; Quartus accepts that, Verilator calls it
// PROCASSWIRE. tb_pc9821_fdd_write_hps instantiates the real module, so the rule is waived for
// that one file here rather than by editing sys/ (which is frozen).
lint_off -rule PROCASSWIRE -file "*sys/hps_io.sv"
